comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-03T11:09:27.894Z","harness:codex","Estimate basis 2026-08-03: 240 minutes covers value-domain declarations, invalid boolean rejection, a correctly named nested-session dimension, corpus check, and regression coverage."
  "2026-08-07T11:23:43.166Z","harness:claude-code","Confirmed still live at 2026.8.7 on 2026-08-07 with no identity flags passed. A create from Claude Code recorded author harness:claude-code with author_source detected, agent_model claude-opus-5 from probe, effort xhigh from environment, version 2.1.224 from probe — and role literally \"1\" from environment, with topic null. Model, effort and version capture are working end to end; role and topic remain the only two dimensions that do not carry meaning. Fleet analytics grouping on role today would bucket every nested session under the string \"1\"."
  "2026-08-08T08:10:41.851Z","harness:claude-code","Reproduced live on 2026-08-08 against pm-cli 2026.8.7, HEAD build. A create recorded this session carries agent_provenance role {value: \"1\", source: \"environment\"} alongside a correctly resolved model {claude-opus-5, probe}, effort {xhigh, environment} and version {2.1.226, probe}. So the dimension is not merely unpopulated: it is populated with the boolean child-session flag rendered as a string, which is worse than null because it types as a valid role and will group every nested claude-code invocation under one meaningless label in fleet analytics. Sibling dimension topic is null in the same record, which pm-3zgh2c owns. Evidence is the last history entry of pm-3lhth4."
  "2026-08-08T22:13:17.083Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-09: active in the coupled context-provenance tranche with pm-3zgh2c, pm-eq9dlw, pm-lu6sca, pm-b1w8vr, and pm-h75tjh. Scope is SDK-first provenance inference and resolver outcomes, typed role domains, stable entity read-back projections, and epoch-aware release classification; all other open items remain unclaimed."
  "2026-08-08T23:34:21.304Z","harness:codex","Tranche pause: Claude child-session boolean is no longer interpreted as role and controlled role validation is covered, but the corpus-wide all-dimension zero-bare-boolean/single-digit check remains to be implemented before closure."
  "2026-08-09T00:09:13.174Z","harness:codex","Broad tranche evidence: Claude boolean child-session data no longer becomes a role; the controlled role vocabulary plus argv review/implementation inference now pass the complete 7086-test 100/100/100/100 gate. Item remains open and unclaimed because its corpus-wide all-dimension bare-boolean and single-digit conformance criterion remains broader than this tranche."
  "2026-08-09T00:20:22.518Z","harness:codex","Delivery handoff: broad SDK/CLI tranche committed at 5b36abc75 and opened as GitHub PR #944 (https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/944). Exact local evidence includes 7,086 tests across 461 files at 100/100/100/100 coverage, package/compatibility/npx/dogfood/manual acceptance, tracker/changelog/SDK/static-quality gates, and zero current dependency or GitHub security alerts. Review and exact-head CI evidence will be appended after the hosted loop."
  "2026-08-09T01:24:45.768Z","harness:codex","PR #944 hosted evidence for the completed tranche portion: implementation commit b6678b8 passed all deterministic checks; all 16 CodeRabbit findings are addressed, replied to, and resolved. Item stays open and unclaimed for its broader remaining role-contract acceptance."
  "2026-08-09T15:57:27.484Z","harness:codex","Evidence: all three linked tests passed; final full suite passed 7,100/7,100 with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage; lint, duplicate, docstring, surface-replication, SDK parity, token/context, and performance gates passed. Live repository health/storage/history checks remain structurally clean."
